    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem green_61 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔\n      ∃ f : ℕ → ℝ, Tendsto f atTop (𝓝 0) ∧\n        ∀ n : ℕ, n ≥ 1 → ∀ (A : Finset ℕ),\n          (Finset.Icc 1 n).image (· ^ 2) ⊆ A + A →\n            (n : ℝ) ^ (1 - f n) ≤ A.card",
